{"4379210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Route", "steam_appid": 4379210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4763410], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/ad3baa54dcbf57aa6268668ab784d50d.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/ad3baa54dcbf57aa6268668ab784d50d.avif?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=524 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When the modular building and resource management of Stacklands collide with the oppressive exploration and real-time survival of Darkwood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across a strange, Lovecraftian sea aboard a living ship, racing against time to survive hunger, madness, and mutation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Then uncover why the sea has turned sweet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore islands unlike any other—from corrupted jungles to reefs of flesh—each hiding its own dangers and secrets.<br>Salvage the remains of sunken ships and piece together the fragments of this twisted world through shattered cabins and decaying journals.<br>Until the truth—or the abyss—swallows you whole.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/790c18238a6fa479ba6bd01ea0fce462.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/790c18238a6fa479ba6bd01ea0fce462.webp?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=232 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure whirlpools, corruption, toxic fog, acid rain, and other unnatural disasters. Manage your health, hunger, thirst, and sanity as you struggle through each desperate day and night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter Cthulhu-inspired aberrations in all shapes and forms. Sneak past them, or combine weapons, traps, and items to hunt them down and harvest their organs as vital resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/d718ea777a0863628718281c7bb95f42.poster.avif?t=1787630480\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/d718ea777a0863628718281c7bb95f42.webm?t=1787630480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/d718ea777a0863628718281c7bb95f42.mp4?t=1787630480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/c08423ae05070f3fb2e7855439091088.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/c08423ae05070f3fb2e7855439091088.webp?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=232 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish the deep sea, explore shipwrecks and ruined islands, and salvage survival supplies, rare treasures, and bizarre materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and equipment, expand your living ship, and unlock new cabins and special functions. Transform an ordinary vessel into an unstoppable fortress at sea.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/c8658b621ece7272e3f8d81218a02501.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/c8658b621ece7272e3f8d81218a02501.avif?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/2b370b7a5a486a75e54be775a5930316.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/2b370b7a5a486a75e54be775a5930316.webp?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=232 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore distinctive islands and ancient ruins, meet the strange inhabitants of these waters, and confront deranged cultists. Every voyage carries you into an unknown crisis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually recover your lost memories and peel back the layers concealing the ultimate truth of this world. In the end, you will face a final Lovecraftian choice: escape the abyss—or become part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/9b141b95aea93e76a8a327173a94577e.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/9b141b95aea93e76a8a327173a94577e.avif?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【WISHLIST NOW—AND SET SAIL WITH US ON THIS DARK ROUTE!】</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras/ad3baa54dcbf57aa6268668ab784d50d.avif?t=1787630480\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379210/extras_big/ad3baa54dcbf57aa6268668ab784d50d.avif?t=1787630480 width=1560 height=524 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>When the modular building and resource management of Stacklands collid